&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;🚀 We’re on a mission to make money work for everyone.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re waving goodbye to the complicated and confusing ways of traditional banking.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;After starting as a prepaid card, our product offering has grown a lot in the last 10 years in the UK. As well as&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/current-account/personal&quot;&gt;personal&lt;/a&gt; and &lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/business-banking&quot;&gt;business&lt;/a&gt; bank accounts, we offer &lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/current-account/joint-account&quot;&gt;joint accounts&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/current-account/16-17&quot;&gt;accounts for 16-17 year olds&lt;/a&gt;, a &lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/current-account/under-16s&quot;&gt;free kids account&lt;/a&gt; and &lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/flex&quot;&gt;credit cards&lt;/a&gt; in the UK, with more exciting things to come beyond. Our UK customers can also &lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/savings&quot;&gt;save&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/investments&quot;&gt;invest &lt;/a&gt;and&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/pensions&quot;&gt;combine their pensions&lt;/a&gt; with us.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;With our hot coral cards and get-paid-early feature, combined with financial education on social media and our award winning customer service, we have a long history of creating magical moments for our customers!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re not about selling products - we want to solve problems and change lives through Monzo ❤️&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;📍London/Cardiff/UK Remote | 💰circa £110,000 + Incentive Awards tied to your performance&amp;nbsp;+ Benefits |&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=tDAT6VxoqQM&quot;&gt;Hear from the team&lt;/a&gt; ✨&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for a &lt;strong&gt;Senior Legal Counsel&lt;/strong&gt; to join our team at Monzo to support our payments business including digital assets and emerging payment technologies. You will report to Monzo’s Director of Legal for Payments &amp;amp; Business Banking, be part of the Legal and Board Governance Collective, and act as a legal business partner for the teams working on these initiatives.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role sits at the intersection of payments, digital assets and emerging payments technologies. You’ll help teams navigate a rapidly evolving legal and regulatory landscape, helping Monzo innovate responsibly while protecting our customers.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll work at all levels in the organisation and with a wide-range of stakeholders from Product Managers and Designers, to Operations professionals and Software Engineers, and Risk, FinCrime and Compliance professionals.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;While payments, digital assets and emerging financial technologies will be your primary focus, more broadly, you will also have opportunities to work within a team of product lawyers to give first rate legal advice and support to Monzo’s Product Collectives, including in areas like personal and business banking.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🔑You’ll play a key role by...&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’ll work directly with senior lawyers, product managers and engineers to provide legal advice and commercial insights to develop and grow Monzo Bank in the UK - and internationally.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In particular, you will:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with product managers to advise on legal matters, in particular relating to the impact of&amp;nbsp; digital assets and emerging financial technologies, and advise on the legal and regulatory requirements for Monzo.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help to develop efficient ways of working to enable Monzo to scale quickly, and ensuring Monzo operates safely and in accordance with the law and regulation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide training and knowledge sharing with other Monzonauts on the impact of laws and regulations for Monzo and our customers in your specialist area..&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Often act as the sole lawyer advising product managers or other colleagues, identifying legal issues proactively, evaluating relevant risks and finding effective solutions to unique and complex business activities.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’ll work closely and collaboratively with Monzo’s Director of Legal for Payments &amp;amp; Business Banking, Director of Product Legal, the General Counsel of Monzo Bank Limited and the other members of the UK Legal team to provide legal advice and commercial insights, in particular in relation to digital assets and other emerging financial technologies, to Product teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’ll be a trusted advisor and will work proactively and collaboratively with other relevant stakeholders and teams across the Monzo Group, including the Product, Risk &amp;amp; Compliance, Supplier Operations, Financial Crime, Fraud and Operations teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’ll advise on the evolving legal and regulatory framework for digital assets and emerging financial technologies, working with colleagues across the UK and EU to&amp;nbsp; to help us identify relevant local legal and regulatory requirements and apply them to our products.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’ll work with colleagues across the Legal and Board Governance Collective to improve the management of our teams’ activities, including through identifying suitable technology solutions to streamline workflows, optimise processes and efficiencies, and increase scalability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’ll proactively manage relationships with external suppliers and law firms to enhance processes around cost management to ensure we are optimising our spend and extracting best value while delivering top-quality legal support.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🤩 We’d love to hear from you if…&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are a technically excellent lawyer with a minimum of 5 years of relevant post-qualification experience, with recent experience of digital assets, emerging financial technologies and the evolving regulatory regime.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have demonstrated experience of advising on laws and regulations relevant to financial services, including the UK regulatory regime as it applies to digital assets and emerging payment technologies.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are a team player and a keen problem solver, skilled at assessing risk and recommending solutions that balance commercial and risk considerations. You think ahead, anticipate relevant challenges, understand the commercial objectives of the teams you support, set clear objectives, and find effective solutions.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are proactive, take initiative to broaden your knowledge, and are passionate about the intersection of banking and technology and the transformation unfolding in consumer finance. You are excited to work in a fast-paced environment and to join us for the next stage of our journey at Monzo!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The interview process:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our interview process involves 3 main stages:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Recruiter call&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Initial call&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Full loop: Technical and behavioural interviews&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our average process takes around 3-4 weeks but we will always work around your availability.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What’s in it for you:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;💰 circa £110,000 + Incentive Awards tied to your performance ➕ benefits&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;✈️ We can help you relocate to the UK&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;📍This role is based in our London office. If you are not based in London, we&#39;re open to discuss this on a case by case basis.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;⏰ We offer flexible working hours and trust you to work enough hours to do your job well, at times that suit you and your team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;📚 Learning budget of £1,000 a year for books, training courses and conferences&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;➕ And much more, see our full list of benefits &lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/careers/&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;here&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This process should take around 3-4 weeks - your schedule is really important to us, so we promise to be as flexible as possible! We have some guidelines on using Artificial Intelligence (AI) to ace an application and interview at Monzo.&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/blog/the-ultimate-guide-on-using-ai-to-ace-an-interview-at-monzo&quot;&gt;You can read them here.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’ll only close this role once we have enough applications for the next stage. Please submit your application as soon as possible to make sure you don’t miss out.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Equal opportunities for everyone&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Diversity and inclusion are a priority for us and we’re making sure we have lots of support for all of our people to grow at Monzo. At Monzo, we’re embracing diversity by fostering an inclusive environment for all people to do the best work of their lives with us. This is integral to our mission of making money work for everyone. You can read more in our &lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/blog/diversity-and-inclusion&quot;&gt;blog&lt;/a&gt;, 2026 &lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/blog/our-2026-diversity-and-inclusion-report&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Diversity and Inclusion Report&lt;/a&gt; and 2025 &lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/blog/gender-pay-gap-report-2025&quot;&gt;Gender Pay Gap Report.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re an equal opportunity employer. All applicants will be considered for employment without attention to age, ethnicity, religion, sex, sexual orientation, gender identity, family or parental status, national origin, or veteran, neurodiversity or disability status.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you have a preferred name, please use it to apply. We don&#39;t need full or birth names at application stage 😊&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;At HelloFresh, our mission is simple: to change the way people eat, forever. As a global digital-native FMCG company and the world&#39;s leading meal kit provider, we are transforming the traditional food supply chain through a data-driven, on-demand model that enables scalable and more sustainable food delivery. The HelloFresh Group includes eight brands serving customers across multiple meal occasions, including HelloFresh, Green Chef, EveryPlate, and Chefs Plate, as well as ready-to-eat meals from Factor and YouFoodz, meat and seafood subscriptions through Good Chop, and pet nutrition with The Pets Table. Through technology, data, and culinary innovation, we deliver personalised food experiences to millions of households worldwide.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Work with HelloFresh in Berlin and its HelloTech organisation — HelloFresh&#39;s global technology backbone with more than 1,000 people, building the digital products that power our end-to-end food experience. From meal kits and ready-to-eat meals to specialty offerings like pet food and premium meat and seafood, HelloTech creates the platforms that bring tailored food solutions to millions of customers every month.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our subscription-based, direct-to-consumer model relies on technology at every step, from customer-facing apps and personalisation logic to pricing, forecasting, supply chain&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role: What&#39;s in the box&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Good Chop is HelloFresh Group&#39;s premium meat and seafood subscription — American-sourced, direct-to-consumer, operating in a competitive market where the experience is the product. The premium positioning is intentional and the aesthetic bar is high.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a full-ownership role in a startup-paced environment. You&#39;ll partner with Product and Engineering on a cross-functional squad — the PM owns the roadmap, you own the UX direction. UX here is a strategic input, not a downstream service.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll bring T-shaped fluency in research and content — enough to drive lightweight discovery independently and contribute meaningfully to both disciplines. For deeper research and content work, you&#39;ll partner with HelloFresh&#39;s central UX research and strategy team and content design experts.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do: The Recipe&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Consumer UX:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;Lead design from concept to shipped product, maintaining accountability for the full consumer experience across touchpoints. You hold a high bar for quality at every stage — from early framing through final execution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategy and roadmap influence: &lt;/strong&gt;Frame problems before they become briefs. Bring evidence-backed consumer insight into squad planning — challenge priorities, surface opportunities, and influence what gets built. You&#39;re a strategic partner in roadmap conversations, contributing to direction from the start.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Craft and execution: &lt;/strong&gt;Hold a high personal bar across UI, interaction design, motion, and UX writing — and raise the standard within the squad. Use animation and motion as intentional tools, not decoration.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Research fluency: &lt;/strong&gt;Bring enough research depth to frame questions, run lightweight studies independently, and collaborate meaningfully with HelloFresh&#39;s central UX research and strategy team on more complex investigations. Translate findings into design direction — you&#39;re a research partner, not a passive consumer of insights.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI-native workflow: &lt;/strong&gt;Use AI across the full workflow: synthesis, discovery, rapid prototyping, design-to-code. A working method that lets you move faster and think sharper.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Content and UX writing: &lt;/strong&gt;Bring enough content fluency to contribute meaningfully to UX copy and brief content design experts when deeper support is needed. Clarity and precision in language are part of your craft bar.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll bring: The Ingredients&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Consumer instinct: &lt;/strong&gt;You&#39;ve worked on consumer-facing products and you understand how real people make decisions — to try something, to stay, to leave. You think about retention as a design problem, not a churn-rate metric. Subscription context is a plus. What matters is whether you think about the full lifecycle, not just the next feature.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategic range: &lt;/strong&gt;You define the problem before designing the solution. You&#39;ve pushed back on a brief, reframed a PM&#39;s question, or changed a roadmap priority through evidence. You bring design into the strategy conversation — not because you were invited, but because you built the case.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Craft mastery: &lt;/strong&gt;High-fidelity UI, interaction design, motion, micro-interaction, UX writing — you hold a high personal bar across all of it. Figma mastery is non-negotiable. You understand front-end constraints well enough to have credible conversations with engineers without hand-holding.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Autonomous operation: &lt;/strong&gt;You&#39;re comfortable owning the full width of the work — strategy, research, execution, content, and stakeholder communication — and energised by the scope that comes with it.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Stakeholder communication and alignment:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;You present clearly, facilitate alignment across functions, and can run a workshop as confidently as you can ship a screen. You adapt under scrutiny and make the case for your decisions with evidence, not opinion.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Research fluency: &lt;/strong&gt;You can frame a research question, run a lightweight study, and translate findings into design direction without needing a researcher to drive the process. You know when to go deeper, how to collaborate with research experts, and how to brief an agency when the question demands it.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI-native in practice: &lt;/strong&gt;Active use of AI tools in live project work — synthesis, discovery, prototyping, design-to-code. This is how you work, not something you&#39;re working towards.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We Offer: The Toppings&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Elevate your lifestyle! Join one of Europe&#39;s fastest-growing tech powerhouses in a dynamic phase of expansion.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Immerse yourself in a diverse global community of 90+ nationalities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enjoy a competitive compensation package that goes beyond the norm, with perks like a HelloFresh- subsidized Pension Scheme, Berlin relocation support, and a Hybrid working model.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Elevate your lifestyle with exclusive discounts on your weekly HelloFresh box and office meals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Invest in your growth with a German language learning budget, and access to the HelloFresh Academy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Plus, we&#39;ve got your well-being covered with mental health support, transportation perks, and working-parent-friendly benefits. From our 24/7 gym access,wellbeing platforms like Headspace and Spill, to sabbatical leave options, HelloFresh is not just a workplace; it&#39;s a lifestyle of perks and possibilities!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
