&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Brief info about Vinted&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Our mission is to make second-hand the first choice, and we&#39;re looking for people who want to help us get there. Every day, we work together to help our members buy and sell pre-loved clothing and lifestyle items, giving each piece a second life – or even a third. &lt;br&gt;The Vinted Group is made up of three business units that support this mission:&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.vinted.com/marketplace&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Vinted Marketplace&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; is Europe’s leading platform for second-hand fashion and a go-to destination for all kinds of pre-loved items, with a growing range of categories. Our platform connects millions of members across 20+ markets, helping great items find a new life.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.vinted.com/vintedgo&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Vinted Go&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt; enhances the shipping experience with a vast network of over 500,000 pick-up and drop-off points, partnering with more than 60 carriers across Europe, with added services like item verification for peace of mind on high-value pieces.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.vinted.com/vintedpay&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Vinted Pay&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt; is the newest part of the Vinted Group, dedicated to bringing secure, reliable payments to buyers and sellers across Europe. Seamlessly integrated into the Vinted app, it helps keep every transaction safe, efficient, and easy for our members.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Founded in 2008 in Lithuania, Vinted began as a way for friends to find new homes for clothes they no longer needed. In 2019, we became Lithuania&#39;s first unicorn! Today, our headquarters remain in Vilnius, and we&#39;ve grown with offices across Europe, supported by a team of over 2,000 people.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Information about the position&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As Vinted Pay Partner Manager, you will be responsible for managing relationships across the entire Vinted Pay partner stack, optimizing our operating model for performance and cost efficiencies, payments business development and commercial negotiations.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As Senior Manager Payments Partnerships, reporting to the Head of Vinted Pay Business and Commercial, you will have ownership of Vinted Pay’s external partner stack across the entire transaction lifecycle. This role is designed for a commercially aggressive, analytically sharp payments professional who thrives on structuring high-stakes partnership deals while driving deep operational optimization. You will move beyond traditional vendor management to build a dynamic, rigorous and competitive partner framework that continuously pressures pricing, improves performance, and expands our product capabilities. Additionally, you will act as an internal intrapreneur, working at the intersection of Business, Product, Engineering, Strategic Finance, and Legal, sourcing and building business cases for new fintech partnerships, that solve real user problems and deliver meaningful business impact.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;In this position, you’ll&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as one of the primary commercial and strategic owners for Vinted Pay’s and Marketplace partner ecosystem, covering Banks, Payment Processors, Payout providers, Identity Verification/KYC providers, and Risk &amp;amp; Fraud prevention partners and the major and regional card networks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Architect a multi-provider operating model that fosters healthy tension among suppliers. Utilize volume routing leverage, benchmark pricing, and conduct regular RFI processes to maintain best-in-class commercial terms, including leading on contract management process&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead structured Quarterly Business Reviews and executive touchpoints. Enforce rigorous SLAs, clear technical performance targets, and accountability across all partners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Continuously evaluate local and emerging payment rails (e.g., Open Banking, Account-to-Account, regional wallets, BNPL) to expand conversion, reduce acquiring overhead, and localize buyer checkout across core markets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leverage technical and commercial expertise in US, UK and EU acquiring card value chain mechanics to maximize authorisation rates.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the end-to-end strategy and execution for measurable cost savings across scheme fees, interchange, cross-border FX markups, and payout transaction costs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build business cases that deliver measurable financial impact (Revenue, GMV, Cost) while solving for user problems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About you&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in payments partnership management, payment business development, or payments product commercial strategy within a major marketplace, merchant, PSP, or high-growth fintech.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A record of navigating the payment acquiring value chains. Deep understanding of Interchange-Plus-Plus pricing structures, card networks (Visa, Mastercard, Amex), acquiring rails and auth-rate optimization and least-cost routing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional negotiation skills with a history of structuring complex, high-value commercial agreements and navigating simultaneous co-opetitive dynamics with global financial institutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong collaboration and organisational skills with the ability to converse fluidly with Engineering, Legal, Compliance, Finance and Product&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent written and spoken English&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work perks&amp;nbsp; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;The opportunity to benefit from our share options programme&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;25 working days of holiday&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Newest MacBook models&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Home office support: we provide IT workstation equipment and a personal budget of up to €540 for home workplace furniture&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Confidential Employee Assistance Program (EAP) for you and your family&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Comprehensive Medical Insurance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Group Life and Income Protection Insurance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;A matched pension scheme up to a set limit&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Access to a discounted gym membership plan&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lunch benefit per working day&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Frequent team-building events&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;A personal monthly budget for shopping on Vinted&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;The opportunity to spend up to 90 days per year - 21 of which can be spent working outside of the EU - on workation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Working at Vinted&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Individual Learning Budget&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We invest in your professional growth! As part of our commitment to continuous learning, we offer an annual learning budget to support your personal and career development through courses, certifications, workshops and more.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hybrid Work&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’ve adopted a hybrid workplace model where 2 days in the office are recommended but not enforced. It’s up to you and your team to decide on the exact days you’ll spend working together in person.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Equal Opportunity&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Vinted Group is committed to building an inclusive workplace where people from all walks of life feel a sense of belonging. We welcome applications from people of all backgrounds, identities and life experiences. At Vinted, all applicants are treated fairly without regard to their race, age, religion or belief, sex, national origin, citizenship, gender identity, sexual orientation, disability, or any other protected characteristic.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;The annual gross salary range for this position is:&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;£60,900&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;£82,300 GBP&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;Are you someone who thrives in a fast-paced environment, where you are given the autonomy and support to handle large amounts of responsibility?&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Are you looking for the opportunity to accelerate your sales career whilst also being surrounded by an exceptional entrepreneurial team with motivated and extremely driven people?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About us&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Retail Insights is Northern Europe’s leading retail forum. We are strengthening the retail ecosystem by building a platform for insights, inspiration, and networking, connecting more than 3,000 leaders yearly from more than 15 countries.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Retail Insights is part of United Media (&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.united-media.com/&quot;&gt;https://www.united-media.com/&lt;/a&gt;) which focuses on building large scale industry media and conferences products in sectors such as insurance, HR, private equity, retail, etc. As of today, we have organically launched 8 media companies and acquired one.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we offer you&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will be a key player in helping to build the greatest global conferences. We will ensure that you are given both the training and tools to succeed in the role and drive you to continue to push yourself in order to maximise your career development. You’ll be based out of our HQ in London where you will have the opportunity to interact with people at all levels across the business. We will offer you the following:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A competitive salary and market leading OTE with our top performers earning over £140,000 annually.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An opportunity for getting operational experience in a scale-up business where both your work and the results are highly tangible and matters to the businesses&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A chance to work closely with our senior leadership team&amp;nbsp; on conference strategies&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;International travel to our conferences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Unlimited growth potential in our group - we strongly believe in and have a track record of promoting internally&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Your mission is to own the full sales cycle in selling high-value conference sponsorships to senior prospects. In order to be successful, your main duties will include:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build new business revenue:&lt;/strong&gt; Deliver credible, professional sales pitches to new prospects in order to achieve ambitious sales targets&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Pipeline development:&lt;/strong&gt; Work with our marketing and analyst team to source, contact and set up meetings with potential sponsors&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Establish client relationships:&lt;/strong&gt; Work closely with our content and delivery teams to ensure best-in-class delivery&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Leverage our expertise:&lt;/strong&gt; Work hand-in-hand with our content team to create compelling pitches to inspire our prospects&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;What we expect from you&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You possess a strong work ethic with a high sense of urgency, and you have both the drive and desire to be the very best at what you do. You take ownership of everything you do, along with having a growth mindset constantly looking for areas to improve. Moreover, you share our passion for building and executing new businesses. We expect that you can demonstrate:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Sales excellence: &lt;/strong&gt;Solid experience and evidence of regularly outperforming targets within a B2B sales role&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Drive &amp;amp; Passion:&lt;/strong&gt; Evidence of a passion for sales and business development&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Team Spirit:&lt;/strong&gt; Are curious about people and love to speak, build and nurture relations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Communication Maestro:&lt;/strong&gt; Showcase stellar verbal and written communication skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Pride in Work:&lt;/strong&gt; Uphold the highest standards, ensuring every task you undertake is a testament to quality.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Startdate&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Flexible, Monday - Friday we work from our office (next to Sloane Square Station) and due to the collaborative nature of our work we do not offer remote work. You must have a UK work permit.&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 18pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(102, 110, 153);&quot;&gt;What Cognite is:&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 41, 255);&quot;&gt;Relentless&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(102, 110, 153);&quot;&gt;to achieve&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Cognite operates at the forefront of &lt;strong&gt;industrial digitalization, building AI&lt;/strong&gt;, and data solutions that solve the world’s hardest, highest-impact problems. With unmatched industrial heritage and a comprehensive suite of AI capabilities, including low-code AI agents, Cognite accelerates the digital transformation to drive operational improvements.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;We thrive in challenges. We challenge assumptions. We execute with speed and ownership. If you view obstacles as signals to step forward - not backwards - you’ll feel right at home here.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.cognite.com/en/company/newsroom/cognite-s-industrial-ai-momentum-soars-driving-ecosystem-impact-at-global-conference&quot;&gt;Moonshot&lt;/a&gt; is bold: Unlock $100B in customer value by 2035, and redefine how global industry works. Join us in this venture where AI and data meet ingenuity, and together, we will forge the path to a smarter, more connected industrial future.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img style=&quot;display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 100%;&quot; width=&quot;708&quot;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;How you’ll demonstrate &lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 41, 255);&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ownership&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;div&gt;As a Solution Architect at Cognite, you will play a pivotal role in the Technology department within our Value Delivery organisation. In this customer-facing position, you will work directly with key customers, field sales, delivery teams, and product development. You will use your seniority and technical competencies to help to lead Norwegian and international industrial customers to increase productivity, profitability, reduce environmental impact and reduce costs. Our customers are large international process and energy industries, with challenges in asset performance and maintenance, production efficiency, and sustainability. Together with the team, you will define solutions and support each integration through to a successful finish.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;End-to-end architecture and solution design leadership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Providing strategic and technical expertise to support customers and the customer-facing project teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Defining enterprise and solution architecture, including integration and data models and data ingestion pipelines, as well as user-facing solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expressing complex technical solutions through architecture modeling tools&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure operational responsibility and support agreements for the delivered solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Building strong relationships with key stakeholders, C-level executives, and IT and Business Data Managers to drive long-term adoption of Cognite’s products and services&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Training internal teams and partners in your area of specialization&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborating with Sales, Engineering, and Product Management teams to translate customer needs into product offerings&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Independently work with managing integration, data modeling, and related activities using Cognite data connectors and extractors, SQL, Python/Java, Rest APIs and Cloud platform providers like Azure, AWS &amp;amp; Google&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with our Sales, Engineering and Product Management teams to turn customer needs into a prioritised pipeline of product offerings&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and maintain technical and business expertise for Cognite’s products&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;The &lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 41, 255);&quot;&gt;Impact&lt;/span&gt; you bring to Cognite&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We expect all our solutions architects to be hands-on in python as well as a good hands-on expertise with software development best practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Open to travel.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You must be highly organised, thorough, and communicate well with all stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Take ownership and drive tasks independently&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You will be required to collaborate, lead, and coach, as well as work independently.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Required Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;6+ years of experience working as a Software Engineer/Data Engineer/Machine Learning Engineer&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Technical background, willing and able to dive in and contribute code for advanced topics when needed&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred Experience&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience from domains like Manufacturing, Energy, O&amp;amp;G, Pharma, Life sciences is preferred&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
